fixture kindle_never_hits_a_corpse
doc docs/adr/0013 (task 6 review, M7): a dead enemy has no hurtbox, and every hit skips the dead. Kindle cast straight up against a hall's left wall reaches the room's origin, where an empty box used to count as a hit on every corpse: another kill, ember and Flame each time.
room test/low_hall
option flame 33
frames 60
input
  0 attack
  30 U spell
end
expect
  at 2 event.kill=1
  at 30 spell=kindle
  never 3..59 event.kill=1
  never 3..59 event.hit=1
end
